Design alignment (not shipped as third-party source)
----------------------------------------------------

Component naming and token semantics align with shadcn/ui and Tailwind CSS
v4 conventions. RUI reimplements these APIs in Rust; upstream React/TS source
is not vendored into this repository.

Local reference snapshots under `Reference/` (when present on a developer
machine) are for comparison only and are not included in published crates.
